# python-dateutil (a kubernetes dependency) pins setuptools_scm<8.0 in its
# build-system.requires, while urllib3 and hatch-vcs need setuptools-scm>=8.
# A single flat build file cannot carry both versions, but pip resolves each
# sdist's build environment independently against the prefetched store, so
# Hermeto fetches this legacy pin as a separate build file and both versions
# coexist in the store.
#
# Kept dependency-free (--no-deps): setuptools-scm 7.x runtime dependencies
# (packaging) are already provided by requirements-build.txt.

setuptools-scm<8
